<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>...</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      background-color: #0f1115;
      color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* Layar pembuka agar browser mengizinkan audio otomatis */
    .overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background-color: #0f1115;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 10;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity 0.9s ease, visibility 0.9s ease;
    }

    .overlay.hidden {
      opacity: 0;
      visibility: hidden;
    }

    .overlay span {
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.55);
      animation: pulse 2s infinite ease-in-out;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 680px;
      text-align: center;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(10px);
      transition: opacity 1.4s ease, transform 1.4s ease;
    }

    .container.visible {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    p {
      font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
      line-height: 1.85;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }

    .en {
      font-style: italic;
      color: rgba(248, 250, 252, 0.55);
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0.35; }
      50% { opacity: 0.85; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <audio id="bg-music" loop preload="auto">
    <source src="lagu.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
  </audio>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlay">
    <span>Ketuk layar untuk membuka</span>
  </div>

  <div class="container" id="content">
    <p class="en">
      It was too late when you finally looked back. There was nothing left but the pain I felt and regret for everything you did to me. There will be no more sorry, no more coming back, and no more accepting you back into my life.
    </p>
    <p>
      tolong jangan pernah datang lagi dalam kehidupanku, karena aku akan selalu berdoa agar tuhan tidak pernah mempertemukan kita di kesempatan manapun.
    </p>
  </div>

  <script>
    const audio = document.getElementById('bg-music');
    const overlay = document.getElementById('overlay');
    const content = document.getElementById('content');

    // Tetap coba putar otomatis langsung jika browser mengizinkan
    window.addEventListener('load', () => {
      audio.play().then(() => {
        overlay.classList.add('hidden');
        content.classList.add('visible');
      }).catch(() => {
        // Jika diblokir browser, tunggu satu ketukan pada overlay
      });
    });

    overlay.addEventListener('click', () => {
      audio.play();
      overlay.classList.add('hidden');
      content.classList.add('visible');
    });
  </script>

</body>
</html>
